  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up to USD 110 million senior loan with 7-year tenor (the &quot;Loan&quot;) to Enerjisa  Enerji Uretim A.S. (the &quot;Company&quot; or &quot;Enerjisa&quot;), one of the largest  independent power producers in Turkiye, with 3.7GW installed capacity.  The proceeds of the Loan will be used for the financing of wind capacity  extension projects with 51.6MW installed capacity and acquisition of an  operational wind power plant with 55.0MW installed capacity (the &quot;Project&quot;).</narrative>
